00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:21.660
disputes will affect the speed of assistance. How do countries decide which rescue teams to accept

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:28.460
first when multiple offers arrive? Turning to aviation, Heathrow expects a fall in passengers and

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:35.600
profits this year linked to regional conflict. Airport operators emphasize adjusting forecasts and

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:42.840
controlling costs to maintain long-term viability when external events reduce demand. Travel industry

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:49.720
