00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:02.080
Both sides agree external events can shift travel volumes quickly, but they differ on how quickly

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:07.560
recovery might occur. What contingency measures protect passenger rights during sudden

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:13.760
schedule changes? Finally, recent US strikes in the Strait of Hormuz occurred during scheduled

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:20.420
